==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{m|non|fljúga}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*fleuganą}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|is}} {{m|ine-pro|*pleuk-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈfljuːa/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|uːa|lang=is}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-strong|flaug|flugu|flogið}}

# {{lb|is|intransitive}} to [[fly]]

====Conjugation====
{{is-conj-s2|fl|jú|g}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|is|fljúga út}} (to [[sell like hotcakes]])
* {{l|is|fljúgandi}} (flying)
* {{l|is|fljúgandi hálka}} (slippery ice)
* {{l|is|fljúgast}}
